!CHECK 232041.40 | 231532.20 10 | line 21 LX,LXSC,LSYMCX
!CHECK 232042.00 | 000000.00 88 060000.20 50 | line 22 LOOPSC L(BU,48),0.0(LXSC),0.0
!CHECK 232043.00 | 232046.34 C6 | line 23 BRZZ,LIOD4
!CHECK 232043.40 | 000004.00 83 060000.21 10 | line 24 K(BU,48),4.0(LIODX),0.0
!CHECK 232044.40 | 232047.36 C6 | line 25 BAEZ,LCHAN
!CHECK 232045.00 | 232042.21 48 | line 26 CB+,LXSC,LOOPSC
!CHECK 232045.40 | 232045.44 00 | line 27 BD,$
